---
import GuardrailSandbox from '../islands/GuardrailSandbox';
---

<section id="visual-proof" tabindex="-1" class="py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32 bg-navy-100/30">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="section-heading">See ReluLayer keep an outnumbered swarm safe against a hostile swarm</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 section-subheading">
        Drag the slider below. A smaller friendly swarm faces a larger hostile swarm and loses all radio contact. ReluLayer keeps formation intact. Turn protection off and watch the swarm collapse.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-gold/30 bg-gold/5 p-5 shadow-gold-glow">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold">Flight Instructor Metaphor</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        Think of ReluLayer as a certified flight instructor with dual controls. When the autopilot issues an erratic command, ReluLayer interdicts in <span class="font-semibold text-gold">0.199 microseconds</span>, projecting the command onto the maximum safe physical boundary so the aircraft keeps flying smoothly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/5 p-5 shadow-sm">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400">Swarm Protection Without Radio</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        In a tactical swarm, ReluLayer runs on every drone. If an adversary jams or spoofs the mesh, the kernel still enforces inter-vehicle separation locally, preventing mid-air collisions without waiting for a restored command link.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-400/10 bg-slate-800/30 p-4">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Tier 2 — Greedy Centrality</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-cream">10.7 ms · 123 KB · 0.9993 ARI</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-400/10 bg-slate-800/30 p-4">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Tier 2 — Hungarian Allocator</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-cream">27.9 µs · 97.08% optimality</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-400/10 bg-slate-800/30 p-4">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">EW State Machine</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-cream">Active α &lt; 0.30 / Passive α ≥ 0.30</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gold/20 bg-gold/5 p-4">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-gold">Tier 1 — ReluLayer™ Kernel</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-cream">0.199 µs · 326 B · 0.00% variance</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <GuardrailSandbox client:load />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
